  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1486\">\n<p data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1206\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1204\">Positive:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1486\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1302\">\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1302\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Indicates <strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1253\">current SARS-CoV-2 infection</strong> (high viral load, typically contagious stage).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1375\">\n<p data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1375\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Should be reported to health authorities as per local regulations.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1486\">\n<p data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1486\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Consider confirmatory <strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1412\">RT-PCR</strong> if clinically indicated (especially in asymptomatic or borderline cases).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1723\">\n<p data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1505\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1503\">Negative:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1723\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1563\">\n<p data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1563\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No detectable viral antigen at the time of testing.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1658\">\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1658\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Does <strong data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1599\">not rule out infection</strong> (especially if tested early or in low viral load phase).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1723\">\n<p data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1723\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">If symptoms persist, recommend <strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1722\">RT-PCR or repeat testing</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
